@{
	Layout = "~/Views/Instruction/Shared/_Layout.cshtml";
}

<div class="instruction-content">
	<ul>
		<li>Given Share (%): the share amount which will be given to an agent.</li>
        <li>Taken Share (%): the share amount taken by the "logged in" agent, particularly on the <b>Soccer Deadball Handicap</b> bet type. If Max Taken Share is X%, then share amount taken on all members of its line must be <= X.</li>
	    <li>[x - y]: input range. If K is the entered amount, then K must be: x <= K <= y.</li>
    </ul>
	<p>
		<span class="note">Note:</span> only allow two numbers after the decimal point. For instance, 80.25 is a valid input, but 80.555 is not.
	</p>
</div>